WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:09.870
You can now purchase "Real Vegan Cheese",
which is synthetic, milk-free cheese, created

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:16.430
using strands of human DNA.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:27.390
Your lips appear red or pink not because the
skin is a different colour, but because the

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:33.710
skin is thinner than normal and you are actually
seeing the underlying blood vessels through

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:34.710
the skin.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:41.290
It took the inventor of the Rubik's cube a
whole month before he was able to solve the

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:44.260
cube for himself.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:50.670
Before dummies were invented human corpses
were used for crash tests.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:57.210
Instead of hiring gardeners Google use 200
goats for mowing the large amount of grass

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:59.000
at their headquarters.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.320
A recent study published in the journal Psychological
Science found that posting an image of a dish

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:11.979
to Instagram before eating it, can make it
taste better.

00:01:11.979 --> 00:01:19.170
The "Grey School of Wizardry" in California
is the first wizards school to be officially

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:23.340
recognised as an academic establishment.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:29.880
In 2005 a man named Ronald MacDonald actually
robbed a Wendy's.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:34.670
The average human being gets through 900 skins
in a lifetime.

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:40.720
There are more people speaking French in Africa
than in France.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:48.079
In Japan, Ronald McDonald is known as Donald
McDonald to make pronunciation easier for

00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:49.079
the Japanese.

00:01:49.079 --> 00:01:56.329
The youngest known person to ever be divorced
was only 10 years old.

00:01:56.329 --> 00:02:02.780
To disguise dead passengers during a flight,
British Airways used to give them sunglasses,

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:07.759
a vodka &amp; tonic and a copy of the Daily Mail.

00:02:07.759 --> 00:02:14.709
To avoid being caught on film by a speed camera,
you would have to be travelling at 28,000

00:02:14.709 --> 00:02:16.959
miles per hour.

00:02:16.959 --> 00:02:23.099
Two-thirds of the world's population has never
seen snow.

00:02:23.099 --> 00:02:30.709
If melted down for scrap, a bronze medal from
the London 2012 Olympic Games would be worth

00:02:30.709 --> 00:02:36.499
less than £3.

